{"id":"0d3415341994255a","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-arithmetic-formula.md","title":"Arithmetic Formulas","display":"df-arithmetic-formula — Arithmetic Formulas","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-arithmetic-formula","aliases":["28-df-arithmetic-formula"],"display":"df-arithmetic-formula — Arithmetic Formulas","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §16.1.3 and Theorem 16.12","source_printed_pages":"322–323,325","source_pdf_pages":"348–349,351","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-arithmetic-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-arithmetic-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetic-formula — Arithmetic Formulas"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §16.1.3 and Theorem 16.12"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"322–323,325"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"348–349,351"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F\">\\(\\mathbb F\\)</span> 为域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,t\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,t\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；叶标签为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(0,a)\">\\((0,a)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb F\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb F\\)</span>）或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1,i)\">\\((1,i)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[n]\">\\(i\\in[n]\\)</span>），内节点为有序二元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\times\">\\(\\times\\)</span>；这些构造子互异。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_1,\\ldots,X_n\">\\(X_1,\\ldots,X_n\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F\">\\(\\mathbb F\\)</span> 上的形式不定元；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]\">\\(\\mathbb F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]\\)</span> 为相应多项式环，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时取为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F\">\\(\\mathbb F\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb F,n}\">\\(\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb F,n}\\)</span> 为以下归纳构造的有限语法树集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{poly}:\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb F,n}\\to\\mathbb F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]\">\\(\\operatorname{poly}:\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb F,n}\\to\\mathbb F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fsize}:\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb F,n}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(\\operatorname{fsize}:\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb F,n}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span> 按结构递归。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G\\in\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb F,n}\">\\(F,G\\in\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb F,n}\\)</span> 为递归式中的直接子树，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{+,\\times\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{+,\\times\\}\\)</span>；常量叶规则的参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb F\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb F\\)</span>，变量叶规则的参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[n]\">\\(i\\in[n]\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_0\\coloneqq(\\{0\\}\\times\\mathbb F)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times[n]),\\qquad\\mathcal A_{t+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal A_t\\cup\\{(\\circ,F,G):\\circ\\in\\{+,\\times\\},\\ F,G\\in\\mathcal A_t\\},\\qquad\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb F,n}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{t\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal A_t.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal A_0\\coloneqq(\\{0\\}\\times\\mathbb F)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times[n]),\\qquad\\mathcal A_{t+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal A_t\\cup\\{(\\circ,F,G):\\circ\\in\\{+,\\times\\},\\ F,G\\in\\mathcal A_t\\},\\qquad\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb F,n}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{t\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal A_t.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{poly}((0,a))\\coloneqq a,\\quad\\operatorname{poly}((1,i))\\coloneqq X_i,\\quad\\operatorname{poly}((\\circ,F,G))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{poly}(F)\\circ\\operatorname{poly}(G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{poly}((0,a))\\coloneqq a,\\quad\\operatorname{poly}((1,i))\\coloneqq X_i,\\quad\\operatorname{poly}((\\circ,F,G))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{poly}(F)\\circ\\operatorname{poly}(G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fsize}((0,a))\\coloneqq1\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb F),\\qquad\\operatorname{fsize}((1,i))\\coloneqq1\\quad(i\\in[n]),\\qquad\\operatorname{fsize}((\\circ,F,G))\\coloneqq1+\\operatorname{fsize}(F)+\\operatorname{fsize}(G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fsize}((0,a))\\coloneqq1\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb F),\\qquad\\operatorname{fsize}((1,i))\\coloneqq1\\quad(i\\in[n]),\\qquad\\operatorname{fsize}((\\circ,F,G))\\coloneqq1+\\operatorname{fsize}(F)+\\operatorname{fsize}(G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>语法树不共享子结果，相同子式出现两次就计两份；这是公式与算术DAG电路的关键差别。良基树递归给唯一多项式。规模采用全节点数，本条未宣称与教材仅运算门数逐实例相同。</p>\n<p>来源：§16.1.3 and Theorem 16.12；印刷页 322–323,325；PDF 页 348–349,351。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第16章的 Arithmetic Formulas，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb F","display":false},{"tex":"n,t\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"(0,a)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb F","display":false},{"tex":"(1,i)","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"+","display":false},{"tex":"\\times","display":false},{"tex":"X_1,\\ldots,X_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb F,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{poly}:\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb F,n}\\to\\mathbb F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fsize}:\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb F,n}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"F,G\\in\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb F,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ\\in\\{+,\\times\\}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb F","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_0\\coloneqq(\\{0\\}\\times\\mathbb F)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times[n]),\\qquad\\mathcal A_{t+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal A_t\\cup\\{(\\circ,F,G):\\circ\\in\\{+,\\times\\},\\ F,G\\in\\mathcal A_t\\},\\qquad\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb F,n}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{t\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal A_t.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{poly}((0,a))\\coloneqq a,\\quad\\operatorname{poly}((1,i))\\coloneqq X_i,\\quad\\operatorname{poly}((\\circ,F,G))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{poly}(F)\\circ\\operatorname{poly}(G).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fsize}((0,a))\\coloneqq1\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb F),\\qquad\\operatorname{fsize}((1,i))\\coloneqq1\\quad(i\\in[n]),\\qquad\\operatorname{fsize}((\\circ,F,G))\\coloneqq1+\\operatorname{fsize}(F)+\\operatorname{fsize}(G).","display":true}],"bytes":2634,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-356","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-arithmetic-straight-line-program]]、[[28-lem-straight-line-degree-bound]]、[[28-df-arithmetic-formula]]、[[28-df-polynomial-projection]]、[[28-df-algebraic-computation-tree]]、[[28-thm-element-distinctness-components]]、[[28-df-bss-machine]]、[[28-df-complex-bss-p-np]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}